; ACCEPTED (serial variant): G53, a move in the
; MACHINE frame
; (REQ-CoreLR-F-GCodeInterpreter-0018): its X Y
; Z are read from the
; calibration reference point, +Y up, absolute
; whatever G90/G91
; says, for that one line. It needs G0 or G1. Z
; >= 0 lifts the pen,
; Z < 0 lowers it. START with the origin where
; it was calibrated
; (menu: Origin = calib.), the pen over
; nothing.
M5
G90 G0 X0 Y0
G21 G17 G54 G94
; shift the origin: the pen, at the reference
; point, reads (30,-30)
G92 X30 Y-30
G0 X50 Y-30
; Candle's Restore origin: G53 to the machine
; origin, then G92
G53 G90 G0 X0 Y0 Z0
G92 X0 Y0 Z0
; G53 is absolute even under G91, and does not
; change it
G91
G53 G0 X10 Y10
G1 X5
G53 G1 X0 Y0
G90
; Safe position: Z0 alone lifts the pen,
; nothing moves
M3
G53 G0 Z0
M5
G90 G0 X0 Y0
M30
